  "title": "Pineapple Cheesecake with Cinnamon",
  "description": "A cinnamon graham cracker crust holds canned pineapple layered with a cream cheese filling and a sour cream-cinnamon topping in this decadent cheesecake.",
  "authors": [
    "terpsichore"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-04-12T16:23:30-04:00",
